      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We've got no plans to increase this limit at the moment.\nCompression is quite powerful! Even with several large textures, my **PC** avatar tends to be around 8-9MB.\nI would encourage you to take a look at crunch compression.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
